  },
  {
    "id": "mohawk-solidtech",
    "name": "Mohawk SolidTech Plus",
    "category": "Rigid Core with Pad, Pet-Focused Lines",
    "badge": "Most Durable All-Rounder",
    "amazonUrl": "",
    "pros": [
      "Thick, durable top layer on many collections",
      "Attached pad for sound and comfort",
      "Strong wood-look visuals with embossing",
      "Good pet-friendly positioning and warranties",
      "Available from many dealers and big-box stores"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Mid-to-upper pricing",
      "Heavier boxes, plan the haul"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "A balanced, durable plank for whole-house installs with kids and pets.",
    "description": "Mohawk's SolidTech Plus line is positioned as its tougher rigid-core option, with a thick top layer, attached underlayment and embossed wood visuals that read convincingly in daylight. It suits whole-house installs where you want one floor to handle the kitchen, the hallway and the living room without upgrading in some rooms and not others. Mohawk emphasizes pet-friendly performance, and owners commonly report that it holds up well to claws and kids' toys when felt pads are used on furniture. The attached pad cuts hollow sound and means no separate underlayment on wood subfloors. It is heavier per carton than budget lines, which reflects a denser core and is worth planning for if you are hauling it upstairs. Pricing sits in the middle to upper part of the market. Check the specific SolidTech collection's wear layer and warranty, because Mohawk runs several tiers under the SolidTech name."
  },
  {
    "id": "nucore-performance",
    "name": "NuCore Performance",
